# SPECTRA architecture (generated from the README Mermaid block)

The diagram source of truth lives in [`../README.md`](../README.md). This file
holds the same graph for tools that prefer a standalone `.mmd` input
(`npx @mermaid-js/mermaid-cli -i docs/architecture.mmd -o docs/architecture.svg`).

```mermaid
flowchart LR
  subgraph Sources
    TG[Public Telegram channels<br/>t.me links / @usernames]
    UP[CSV / JSON / ZIP uploads]
    IMG[Images, QR codes, voice notes]
  end
  TC[Telethon collector<br/>public-only guard] 
  IMP[CSV/JSON importer]
  TG --> TC
  UP --> IMP
  IMG --> PIPE
  NORM[Normalizer<br/>unicode · leetspeak · emoji] --> LEX[Curated lexicon]
  NORM --> EMB[MiniLM embedding head]
  LEX --> TFIDF[TF-IDF head]
  TFIDF --> STACK[Calibrated stack]
  EMB --> STACK
  LEX --> STACK
  STACK --> FIN[Financial-ad detector]
  TC --> PIPE[Pipeline orchestrator]
  IMP --> PIPE
  PIPE --> OCR[OCR hi+en · QR · Whisper]
  OCR --> IDS[Identifier extractors]
  IDS --> STACK
  STACK --> ALERTS[Alerts + SHA-256 evidence]
  IDS --> GRAPH[Entity graph + campaigns]
  GRAPH --> ALERTS
  ALERTS --> DB[(Supabase Postgres / SQLite)]
  API[FastAPI] --> DB
  UI[React dashboard] --> API
  DB -. Realtime .-> UI
```
